# TargetedPlayer$<property> (AbilityUtils.java:574-580, playerXProperty
# :3559-3561): Gaze of Adamaro's `X:TargetedPlayer$CardsInHand` counts the
# hand of the player the spell targets (SpellAbility.getSATargetingPlayer) --
# the opponent's three cards, not the caster's one -- so it deals 3.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
